meta {
  name: All Orders
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/orders?output_format={{outputFormat}}&display=full
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  output_format: {{outputFormat}}
  display: full
}

docs {
  # Create Order
  
  Converts cart items into a confirmed booking order.
  
  ## Required Fields
  - `id_customer`: Customer ID
  - `id_cart`: Cart ID containing booking items
  - `current_state`: Order state (1 = Payment accepted)
  - `payment`: Payment method
  - `total_paid`: Total amount paid
  - `total_paid_tax_incl`: Total including tax
  - `total_paid_tax_excl`: Total excluding tax
  - `total_paid_real`: Actual amount received
  - `id_currency`: Currency ID
  - `id_lang`: Language ID
  - `secure_key`: Security validation key
  - `id_address_delivery`: Delivery address ID (required)
  - `id_address_invoice`: Invoice address ID (required)
  
  ## Order States
  - 1: Payment accepted
  - 2: Processing
  - 3: Shipped
  - 6: Canceled
  - 10: Awaiting payment
  
  ## Response
  Returns the created order with booking confirmation details.
  
  ## Notes
  - This finalizes the booking process
  - Cart items become confirmed bookings
  - Payment validation should be done before order creation
  - Order creation triggers confirmation emails
}
